*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&      Form  SET_FIELDCAT
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM SET_FIELDCAT USING PR_T_GRID TYPE REF TO DATA
               CHANGING PT_FCAT TYPE LVC_T_FCAT.

  FIELD-SYMBOLS : <LT_GRID> TYPE ANY TABLE.
  ASSIGN PR_T_GRID->* TO <LT_GRID>.

  IF <LT_GRID> IS NOT ASSIGNED.
    " ASSIGN 실패의 경우
    GS_ERR-CODE = 'FA31'.
    GS_ERR-MSG = 'Assign Failed Error'.

    MESSAGE |{ GS_ERR-MSG } (ErrCode { GS_ERR-CODE }| TYPE 'I' DISPLAY LIKE 'E'.
    RETURN.

  ENDIF.

  DATA(LO_TABLE) = CAST CL_ABAP_TABLEDESCR( CL_ABAP_TYPEDESCR=>DESCRIBE_BY_DATA( <LT_GRID> ) ).
  DATA(LO_STRUCT) = CAST CL_ABAP_STRUCTDESCR( LO_TABLE->GET_TABLE_LINE_TYPE( ) ).

  " 동적으로 Field Catalog 생성
  PT_FCAT = CORRESPONDING #( CL_SALV_DATA_DESCR=>READ_STRUCTDESCR( R_STRUCTDESCR = LO_STRUCT )
                             MAPPING KEY        = KEYFLAG
                                     COLTEXT    = FIELDTEXT
                                     REF_TABLE  = REFTABLE
                                     REF_FIELD  = REFFIELD
                                     CFIELDNAME = PRECFIELD
                                     QFIELDNAME = PRECFIELD ).

  LOOP AT PT_FCAT ASSIGNING FIELD-SYMBOL(<LS_FCAT>).
    " Option 부여
    <LS_FCAT>-COL_POS = SY-TABIX.
    <LS_FCAT>-COL_OPT = ABAP_ON.

  ENDLOOP.


ENDFORM.
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&      Form  DISPLAY_ALV
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM DISPLAY_ALV USING PV_TITLE  TYPE LVC_TITLE
                       PO_GRID   TYPE REF TO CL_GUI_ALV_GRID
              CHANGING PR_T_GRID TYPE REF TO DATA
                       PT_FCAT   TYPE LVC_T_FCAT.

  FIELD-SYMBOLS <LT_GRID> TYPE ANY TABLE.
  ASSIGN PR_T_GRID->* TO <LT_GRID>.

  CALL METHOD PO_GRID->SET_TABLE_FOR_FIRST_DISPLAY
    EXPORTING
      IS_VARIANT                    = GS_VARIANT  " Layout
      I_SAVE                        = GV_SAVE     " Save Layout
      IS_LAYOUT                     = GS_LAYO     " Layout
    CHANGING
      IT_OUTTAB                     = <LT_GRID>   " Output Table
      IT_FIELDCATALOG               = PT_FCAT     " Field Catalog
    EXCEPTIONS
      INVALID_PARAMETER_COMBINATION = 1
      PROGRAM_ERROR                 = 2
      TOO_MANY_LINES                = 3
      OTHERS                        = 4.

ENDFORM.
