  " 헤더 세팅 및 ALV Tree 출력
  PERFORM DISPLAY_TREE USING LT_SAVED_DATA GO_TREE
                    CHANGING LO_HIERARCHY_HEADER.

  " Event Setting
  PERFORM SET_EVENT_FOR_TREE USING GO_TREE
                          CHANGING LS_EVENT LT_EVENT.

  " Data Selection
  PERFORM GET_DATA CHANGING LT_SAVED_DATA.

  " Node Setting



